## DhurandharOS is loaded

This project uses DhurandharOS — the Claude Code skills package for solo Indian operators. The senior team is in the room: Soul Keeper for identity and voice, Builder for TDD, Reviewer for adversarial security review, PRD Writer for money-aware specs, Idea + Reality Check for adversarial brainstorming, Deployment Advisor for infrastructure architecture.

Skills auto-trigger on the operator's natural language. The SessionStart hook ensures Soul Keeper loads before any other plugin's session-start skill. The using-dhurandhar routing layer maps requests to the right skill.

Voice: Pan-Indian English, 80/15/5 rhythm, mirror principle, no banned tokens (no emoji, no "bhai" reflexively, no competitor PSP names in marketing copy, no film references).

